-- Their Numbers Are Legion (38819): the war-progress bar counts kills around Inferno Peak and the Brood Queen's
-- Court, but of the 18 creature types that feed it only 5 were spawned (15 creatures). Spawns from Wowhead's map
-- pins (Mardum floor 0) through the Mardum fit, pins within 10 yards merged, z from the map files. Left out: pins
-- within 120 yards of the Illidari Foothold (the intro invasion), spots within 10 yards of an existing spawn of the
-- same creature, the Doom Fortress Stabilizers (immune to players), Count Nefarious (pins only on another map
-- floor) and the Soul Harvesters (no pins). Named bosses get one spawn each.
-- Pins put about a third of the spawns on slopes, so one standing on ground steeper than 20 degrees was moved to
-- the nearest flat navmesh ground (connected to the roads, not magma) within 20 yards. The pins over the upper
-- slopes of Inferno Peak belong to the Foul Creche cave under it: those stand on the cave floor instead, Prolifica
-- hidden below her fel pool where the user placed her in game (.gps), facing her tome;
-- one with no cave floor near was dropped.
DELETE FROM `creature` WHERE `guid` BETWEEN 14811001 AND 14811500;
